              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 149.0\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.aol.com/\n2. Observe\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe news carousel context is visible\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe news carousel cards context is missing\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/215503",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
