              "author": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 2030614,
              "count": 12,
              "creation_time": "2026-05-06T15:12:52Z",
              "creator": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18067734,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "It seems like the <script> node for `wafer-core.3d838d4a9e8eb572.js` is inserted after it loads and before inserting the <script> node for `wf-text-1.20.js` but because `wafer-core` takes longer to compile it ends up executing afterwards.",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "It seems like the <script> node for `wafer-core.3d838d4a9e8eb572.js` is inserted after it loads and before inserting the <script> node for `wf-text-1.20.js` but because `wafer-core` takes longer to compile it ends up executing afterwards.",
              "time": "2026-05-06T15:12:52Z"
            },
            {
              "attachment_id": null,
              "author": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 2030614,
              "count": 13,
              "creation_time": "2026-05-06T15:35:46Z",
              "creator": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18067777,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "It looks like the script loading code comes from next.js:\nhttps://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/04294cb47a6d67adf73c8b6f196ed6a2ddcb2b0e/packages/next/src/client/script.tsx#L61\n\nHowever there's an obfuscated ad related script `3decajspqn3ue.js` that is hooking script loading and might be breaking things",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "It looks like the script loading code comes from next.js:\nhttps://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/04294cb47a6d67adf73c8b6f196ed6a2ddcb2b0e/packages/next/src/client/script.tsx#L61\n\nHowever there's an obfuscated ad related script `3decajspqn3ue.js` that is hooking script loading and might be breaking things",
              "time": "2026-05-06T15:35:46Z"
            },
            {
              "attachment_id": null,
              "author": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 2030614,
