              "id": 18068123,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "https://github.com/jrmuizel/next.js-script-loading-order\n\nIn Safari and Chrome Script 1 always runs first. In Firefox it always runs last",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "https://github.com/jrmuizel/next.js-script-loading-order\n\nIn Safari and Chrome Script 1 always runs first. In Firefox it always runs last",
              "time": "2026-05-06T17:52:37Z"
            },
            {
              "attachment_id": null,
              "author": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 2030614,
              "count": 17,
              "creation_time": "2026-05-06T18:04:02Z",
              "creator": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18068151,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "Having the `<link rel=\"preload\">` tags makes Chrome's behaviour a lot more deterministic. If I make script-1.js a lot bigger (17MB instead of 179KB) I'm able to get Chrome to run it last.",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Having the `<link rel=\"preload\">` tags makes Chrome's behaviour a lot more deterministic. If I make script-1.js a lot bigger (17MB instead of 179KB) I'm able to get Chrome to run it last.",
              "time": "2026-05-06T18:04:02Z"
            },
            {
              "attachment_id": null,
              "author": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 2030614,
              "count": 18,
              "creation_time": "2026-05-06T19:23:31Z",
              "creator": "jmuizelaar@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18068293,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "This seems fixed by setting `dom.script_loader.external_scripts.speculate_link_preload.enabled=true`",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "This seems fixed by setting `dom.script_loader.external_scripts.speculate_link_preload.enabled=true`",
